Changes made

The dataset authors released data, not these weights. The Drishyam team trained a
UNet with a MobileNetV3-Large encoder on the dacl10k train split
(training/train_dacl10k.py) and exported it with the 19 dacl10k classes merged
onto Drishyam's 6 inside the graph (training/class_map.json). No dacl10k images or
labels are included in these files or in this repository.
